					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Status"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:47.661469+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:47.661469+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "SN68xoDgQH6Sqm9JBzQ3DQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A named `object` declares a type and its only instance at once. Its name is used both as a type and as a value. It can extend classes, implement interfaces and have members, but it has no constructors. FAMIX has no entity for this."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:47.890725+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:47.890725+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "tuCJaQ27R/6VlOQe2VP9mA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Other importers reuse the closest FAMIX entity. {{gtClass:GtSmaCCJavaImporter}} turns interfaces into a `FAMIXClass` with `isInterface: true`, and records into a plain `FAMIXClass` ({{gtMethod:GtSmaCCJavaImporter>>importRecords}}). Ruby subclasses it: {{gtClass:GtRubyClass}} is a `FAMIXClass` that answers `isRubyClass` with true, and `FAMIXClass>>isRubyClass` is an extension that answers false."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:48.27219+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:48.27219+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "RWrRi+AxTl6hNhuFCIObmQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Platform importers built on this model (JVM, JS, Native) need to know a class is an object to find usages from other languages. Each platform reaches the instance differently: `Foo.INSTANCE` on the JVM, an accessor such as `Foo.getInstance()` for an exported JS object (depends on the compiler version), `Foo.shared` from Swift. That access idiom is platform knowledge. Being an object is a Kotlin fact."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:48.643159+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:47:48.643159+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "4pyHlXu6TDG3WVDTcu/1XQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Options: (A) a plain `FAMIXClass`, with a `FAMIXClass>>isKotlinObject` extension that reads an entity property; (B) a `GtKotlinObject` subclass of `FAMIXClass` that answers true, with a `FAMIXClass>>isKotlinObject` extension that answers false."
						}
					]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-30T17:46:46.04295+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
